# Localization: all `.resx` cultures

When validators use **`WithErrorCode(nameof(Errors.SomeKey))`** (or equivalent):

- Add the key to the **default** resource file (e.g. `Errors.resx`).
- Add the same key to **each** localized file (e.g. `Errors.sr-Latn-RS.resx`, `Errors.hr-HR.resx`) that the app ships.

Missing keys show raw names or wrong fallbacks. Update **every** culture file you maintain whenever you introduce a new error code.
